\id GEN Sample
\h Genesis
\c 1
\p
\v 1 In the beginning God created the heavens and the earth.
\v 2 The earth was formless\f + \fr 1:2 \ft Or “empty.”\f* and void.
\v 3-4 God said, “Let there be light,” and there was the \w light|lemma="אוֹר" strong="H0216"\w*.
\v 5 He called the light “Day” — and the darkness “Night.”
